guide forever/reputation/gnomeregan-exiles
title Gnomeregan Exiles Reputation
category Reputation
folder Reputation · Cities
faction Alliance
levels 12-60
zone Ironforge
keywords Gnomeregan Exiles, Bubulo Acerbus, cloth quartermaster, Tinker Town, Additional Runecloth, Wool, Silk, Mageweave, Runecloth, mechanostrider, Swift Green Mechanostrider, grey quests, Coldridge Valley, Kharanos, Dun Morogh, Laris Geardawdle, ooze, Overmaster Pyron
reward text Exalted with Gnomeregan Exiles: in Classic, other races may buy the mechanostriders
reward text 400 Gnomeregan reputation from Laris Geardawdle's ooze jars and Overmaster Pyron (level 52-54)
reward text About 3,000 Gnomeregan reputation from low-level quests in Dun Morogh, paid to Ironforge too (in Classic, a fifth of it at 60)
why Cloth, Laris's ooze quests and the Dun Morogh hubs, which pay Ironforge too: best done while leveling.

# Built from Forever's quest data (the reputation each quest pays, as Forever's
# quest pages give it), quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (givers, drops,
# farm spots), and the Forever client tables (Faction: Gnomes start at 4000,
# Humans, Dwarves and Night Elves at 3100, Alliance Skyborne at 2000;
# ItemSparse: no item needs Gnomeregan standing, and the mechanostriders carry
# no reputation requirement in the client).
# Numbers: the first donation of each cloth pays 150 (60 cloth); Additional
# Runecloth (7812) pays 50 for 20 Runecloth and repeats. Bands: Friendly 6000,
# Honored 12000, Revered 21000.
# Low-level quests: in Classic a quest 6+ levels below you pays a fifth less per
# level, down to a fifth; one Forever beta report saw full pay at level 30.
# The Alterac Valley turn-ins of Classic's early patches (Gnomeregan Bounty,
# 7364, Tauren Hoof) are in the game's data without a Forever page value:
# left out.
# The quest hubs are optional: each hub's first step carries a label, the
# steps after it run only when it was done (`when done`), so skipping the
# first step skips the hub.
# Level 52-54 quests first (in Classic they pay a little less at 60): Laris
# Geardawdle's two ooze quests (4512, 4513: 300) and Overmaster Pyron (4262:
# 100). Left to a tip: Incendius! in Blackrock Depths (4263: 100, a group)
# and Nefarian's head (200 to every Alliance city).
# ASSUMED: other races buy the mechanostriders at Exalted with Gnomeregan
# Exiles (Classic flow; Forever's data has no vendor rule for it). In-game
# check: Milli Featherwhistle's stock for a non-Gnome at Exalted and below.
# INGAME: grey-quest rep at 60 (Classic: a fifth from 9 levels below; one Forever beta report: full, quest 456 at level 30 paid 100)
# INGAME: reputation discount (Classic: 10% at Honored with the vendor's faction; Forever guide sites report 5% at Friendly rising to 20% at Exalted, another says unannounced). Check a city vendor's price at Friendly and at Honored.
# Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers here leave it out.
# No race has a reputation bonus in Forever (Diplomacy is gone).

step Bubulo Acerbus, the cloth quartermaster
  tip Bubulo Acerbus takes cloth for the Gnomeregan Exiles; he stands in Tinker Town in Ironforge, by the tram. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth pays 150 reputation once; after the Runecloth one, Additional Runecloth pays 50 for every 20 Runecloth, as often as you like. The Auction House in the Commons is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do Dun Morogh (levels 1-12) and Gaxim Rustfizzle's quests in Stonetalon (20-25) while you level. After the donations come Laris Geardawdle's ooze quests and Overmaster Pyron (400), then the optional Dun Morogh hubs, best rate first: Coldridge Valley (about 38 a minute at full value), Kharanos (26), the quarry (17). Every Gnomeregan gain also gives a quarter as much to Stormwind, Ironforge and Darnassus, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.
  level 12
  collect 2592 x60 nearest            -- Wool Cloth: troggs, gnolls and kobolds in Loch Modan and the Wetlands
  accept 7807
  turnin 7807

step A Donation of Silk
  tip Silk Cloth drops from humanoids level 23 to 40: the Dragonmaw of the Wetlands, the Syndicate of Alterac and Arathi, Stranglethorn's trolls.
  level 26
  collect 4306 x60 nearest
  accept 7808
  turnin 7808

step A Donation of Mageweave
  tip Mageweave Cloth drops from humanoids level 35 to 50: the Shadowforge and Dark Iron dwarves of the Badlands and Searing Gorge, the Dunemaul ogres of Tanaris, the Hatecrest naga of Feralas.
  level 40
  collect 4338 x60 nearest
  accept 7809
  turnin 7809

step A Donation of Runecloth
  tip Runecloth drops from humanoids level 50 and up: the Scourge cultists and Scarlet Crusade in the Plaguelands, the Deadwood furbolgs of Felwood, the Winterfall furbolgs of Winterspring. Keep any Runecloth past the first 60 for Additional Runecloth.
  level 50
  collect 14047 x60 nearest
  accept 7811
  turnin 7811

step Tinker Town: Laris Geardawdle
  zone Ironforge
  tip Laris Geardawdle in Tinker Town wants ooze samples for her research: 150 Gnomeregan reputation for each of her two quests (level 52 and 54: in Classic 60 and 120 of it at 60). She hands you the empty jars.
  level 55
  accept 4512                         -- A Little Slime Goes a Long Way, +150

step Felwood: Cursed and Tainted Oozes
  zone Felwood
  tip The Cursed and Tainted Oozes slide about the streams and fel pools around Jaedenar and Bloodvenom Falls: kill one and use an empty jar on its remains.
  collect 11947 x6 quest 4512.1       -- Filled Cursed Ooze Jar
  collect 11949 x6 quest 4512.2       -- Filled Tainted Ooze Jar

step Tinker Town: the second jars
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 4512
  accept 4513                         -- A Little Slime Goes a Long Way, +150

step Un'Goro Crater: Primal Oozes
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip The Primal Oozes live in the pools around Fire Plume Ridge in the middle of the crater; the Muculent and Glutinous Oozes fill the jars too. Kill one and use a jar on its remains.
  collect 11954 x10 quest 4513.1      -- Filled Pure Sample Jar

step Tinker Town: hand in
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 4513

step Morgan's Vigil: Jalinda Sprig
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Jalinda Sprig at Morgan's Vigil, in the south-east of the Burning Steppes, wants Overmaster Pyron dead: 100 Gnomeregan reputation (level 52: in Classic 40 at 60). Her next quest, Incendius!, needs a Blackrock Depths group: 100 more, in full.
  accept 4262                         -- Overmaster Pyron, +100

step Blackrock Mountain: Overmaster Pyron
  zone map 1415
  tip Blackrock Mountain stands in the west of the Burning Steppes. Overmaster Pyron, a fire elemental, walks the lava paths inside it, near the door of Blackrock Depths but outside the dungeon: at 60 you take him alone.
  kill 9026 quest 4262.1              -- Overmaster Pyron

step Morgan's Vigil: hand in
  zone Burning Steppes
  turnin 4262                         -- Jalinda Sprig

step Coldridge Valley
  label ge-coldridge
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Optional: the Dwarf and Gnome start valley south-west of Kharanos, about 1,150 reputation (230 at a fifth) in 30 minutes at 60. Sten Stoutarm and Balir Frosthammer stand at Anvilmar. In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Skip this step to skip the hub.
  accept 179
  accept 3361
  accept 2160

