step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  zone Ironforge
  tip Additional Runecloth: 50 reputation for 20 Runecloth, as often as you like. After the four first donations a Human, Dwarf or Night Elf stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 Runecloth (Gnomes start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; Skyborne start at Neutral 2,000, so 6,400 away: 128, two fewer after Exploring the Alliance). Laris's and Jalinda's quests above take 8 turn-ins off; each Dun Morogh hub you did takes 10 to 26 more off if it paid in full. Outside Dun Morogh Gnomeregan pays little: Gaxim Rustfizzle's quests in Stonetalon (about 500) and Tinker Town's Gnomeregan dungeon quests. Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your Runecloth at once.
  collect 14047 x20 optional nearest
  turnin 7812 direct optional
  rep 54 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  tip Honored: in Classic the Gnomeregan Exiles' vendors take 10% off for you, Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders (20g, the swift ones 200g) included; Forever has not settled it, and guide sites report 5% at Friendly rising to 20% at Exalted. Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation: 240 turn-ins, 4,800 Runecloth.
  collect 14047 x20 optional nearest
  turnin 7812 direct optional
  rep 54 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  tip Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 420 turn-ins, 8,400 Runecloth. At Exalted, Milli Featherwhistle at Steelgrill's Depot in Dun Morogh sells her mechanostriders to other races in Classic; the Mechanostrider and Swift Mechanostrider guides cover them.
  collect 14047 x20 optional nearest
  turnin 7812 direct optional
  rep 54 Exalted
